-Sessions never expire.
+## Session expiry
+
+Each saved session records an `issued_at` timestamp. A session older than
+`SESSION_TTL` (3600 seconds) is rejected by `load_session` with
+`SessionExpiredError`. `load_session` also calls `purge_expired()`, which deletes
+expired entries from the on-disk cache (`/tmp/sessioncache`).
+
+Resume blobs are base64-encoded JSON (`{"issued_at": ..., "session": {...}}`),
+not pickle.
+
